      "text": "Let Jane's current age be $x$ years.\n\nAccording to the problem, one year ago, Jane's age is $x-1$.\n\nIf we square $x-1$, we get a perfect square.\n\nOne year from now, Jane's age is $x+1$.\n\nIf we cube $x+1$, we get a perfect cube.\n\nTherefore, $x=2$ is also a possible solution.\n\nHence, the answer is: $\\boxed{2}$",
